# Badge

Use Badge for compact metadata, categories, and statuses. Use `AesirPill` when the label is a link.

<DocsExample title="Badge usage example" source={badgeExampleSource} htmlSource={badgeExampleHtmlSource}><BadgeExample /></DocsExample>

Variants are `default`, `secondary`, `outline`, `accent`, `info`, `success`, `warning`, and `destructive`. Sizes are `xs`, `sm`, `default`, and `lg`. Keep labels short and include text or an icon instead of communicating state through color alone.

## Pill

Pill is the link counterpart to Badge. Use it for navigation, not actions.

<DocsExample title="Pill link usage example" source={pillExampleSource} htmlSource={pillExampleHtmlSource}><PillExample /></DocsExample>

Sizes are `sm`, `default`, and `lg`.
